# Fake script: a tracker that splits one voice and mislabels one line, 3 people. Format: crates/pam-speech/src/fake.rs
# Words are NeMo-style 80 ms emission stamps every 0.32 s; spans settle 2.88 s late, as the live diarizer's labels do.
# Cases for manual corrections:
# - Marcus is heard as two voices: spk_1 ("Marcus here", named by the intro fast path) and
#   spk_3 (the release lines, never introduced). Fix: merge spk_3 into Marcus.
# - Jordan's answer "Sure, I'll send them tonight." lands on Alice's slot, right after Alice
#   asks Jordan for the mockups (u0007). Fix: move u0007 to Jordan.
